%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'fontSize': '14px'}}}%%

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User as 👤 User
    participant CMD as 🎯 /code-qa
    participant WA as 🔍 workspace-analyzer
    participant ENV as 🔧 env-setup
    participant GIT as 📂 git-input
    participant QA as 🔬 Host QA
    participant SANDBOX as 🐳 Docker Sandbox
    participant COMMIT as 📝 git-committer
    participant PUSH as 📤 git-pusher

    User->>CMD: /code-qa --last

    rect rgb(155, 89, 182, 0.2)
        Note over WA: Phase 0: Workspace Analysis
        CMD->>WA: 워크스페이스 분석 요청
        WA->>WA: 캐시 확인
        alt 캐시 없음/만료
            WA->>WA: 프로젝트 분석
            WA->>WA: 캐시 저장
        end
        WA-->>CMD: 분석 결과 (캐시)
    end

    rect rgb(149, 165, 166, 0.2)
        Note over ENV,GIT: Phase 1-2: Setup
        CMD->>ENV: 환경 확인 요청
        ENV-->>User: Shell/환경 선택
        User->>ENV: 선택 완료
        ENV-->>CMD: 환경 설정 완료

        CMD->>GIT: Git diff 추출
        GIT-->>CMD: 변경 파일 5개
    end

    rect rgb(52, 152, 219, 0.2)
        Note over QA: Phase 3-6: Host QA
        CMD->>QA: QA 시작
        QA->>QA: Pre-Check (Lint/Format)
        QA->>QA: Code Review (CoT)
        QA->>QA: Code Fix
        QA->>QA: Quality Check

        alt 점수 < 70%
            loop 최대 3회
                QA->>QA: Code Fix 재실행
                QA->>QA: Quality Check
            end
        end
        QA-->>CMD: QA 완료 (85/100)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 126, 34, 0.2)
        Note over SANDBOX: Phase 7-8: Docker Sandbox
        CMD->>SANDBOX: docker run --gpus all
        SANDBOX-->>User: 환경 확인 요청
        User->>SANDBOX: 확인
        SANDBOX->>SANDBOX: Build Test
        SANDBOX->>SANDBOX: Function Test
        SANDBOX-->>CMD: 테스트 통과 ✅
    end

    rect rgb(39, 174, 96, 0.2)
        Note over COMMIT,PUSH: Phase 9-11: Git
        CMD->>COMMIT: 커밋 요청
        COMMIT-->>User: 커밋 메시지 확인
        User->>COMMIT: 확인
        COMMIT-->>CMD: 커밋 완료

        CMD->>CMD: Summary Report 생성

        CMD->>PUSH: Push 요청
        PUSH-->>User: Push 할까요?
        User->>PUSH: Yes
        PUSH->>PUSH: git push
        PUSH-->>User: PR 생성할까요?
        User->>PUSH: Yes
        PUSH-->>User: PR URL 반환
    end

    CMD-->>User: 🎉 Code QA 완료!
